00:05:25,263 --> 00:05:31,263
Find the courage, fight together.

2
00:10:50,526 --> 00:10:56,526
Jarhead 2: Field of Fire is a war, action film directed by Don Michael Paul.

3
00:16:15,789 --> 00:16:21,789
Battle-scarred and disillusioned by the war, Corporal Chris Merrimette is put in charge of a unit whose
next mission is to resupply a remote outpost on the edge of Taliban-controlled territory.

4
00:21:41,052 --> 00:21:47,052
While driving through the hostile Helmand province, a Navy SEAL flags down their convoy and enlists the unit on an operation of
international importance: they must help an Afghan woman famous for her defiance of the Taliban escape the country.

5
00:27:06,315 --> 00:27:12,315
Without tanks or air support, Merrimette and his team will need all the courage and firepower they can
muster to fight their way across the war-torn country and shepherd the woman to safety.

6
